            THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The second condition is that subsection (4A) or (4B) is satisfied for each of the documents listed in the applicable paragraphs of section 911(3)(a) to (f)"
        IF elem NOTHING `for each of the documents the answer of subsection (4A) or subsection (4B)`
